{"verse_key": "14:37", "surah": 14, "verse": 37, "text_uthmani": "رَّبَّنَآ إِنِّىٓ أَسْكَنتُ مِن ذُرِّيَّتِى بِوَادٍ غَيْرِ ذِى زَرْعٍ عِندَ بَيْتِكَ ٱلْمُحَرَّمِ رَبَّنَا لِيُقِيمُوا۟ ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ فَٱجْعَلْ أَفْـِٔدَةً مِّنَ ٱلنَّاسِ تَهْوِىٓ إِلَيْهِمْ وَٱرْزُقْهُم مِّنَ ٱلثَّمَرَٰتِ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَشْكُرُونَ", "translation": "Our Lord, I have settled some of my descendants in an uncultivated valley near Your sacred House, our Lord, that they may establish prayer. So make hearts among the people incline toward them and provide for them from the fruits that they might be grateful.", "verse_from_ms": 809680, "verse_to_ms": 829190, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/14.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "رَّبَّنَآ", "start_ms": 809680, "end_ms": 811550}, {"i": 1, "text": "إِنِّىٓ", "start_ms": 811550, "end_ms": 813560}, {"i": 2, "text": "أَسْكَنتُ", "start_ms": 813560, "end_ms": 814820}, {"i": 3, "text": "مِن", "start_ms": 814820, "end_ms": 819130}, {"i": 4, "text": "ذُرِّيَّتِى", "start_ms": 819130, "end_ms": 820350}, {"i": 5, "text": "بِوَادٍ", "start_ms": 820350, "end_ms": 821810}, {"i": 6, "text": "غَيْرِ", "start_ms": 821810, "end_ms": 823270}, {"i": 7, "text": "ذِى", "start_ms": 823270, "end_ms": 825070}, {"i": 8, "text": "زَرْعٍ", "start_ms": 825070, "end_ms": 826290}, {"i": 9, "text": "عِندَ", "start_ms": 826290, "end_ms": 828535}, {"i": 10, "text": "بَيْتِكَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 11, "text": "ٱلْمُحَرَّمِ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 12, "text": "رَبَّنَا", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 13, "text": "لِيُقِيمُوا۟", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 14, "text": "ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 15, "text": "فَٱجْعَلْ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 16, "text": "أَفْـِٔدَةً", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 17, "text": "مِّنَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 18, "text": "ٱلنَّاسِ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"